    "html": "<p>A satellite orbits planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> with a speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{X}\"></span> at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> from the centre of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span>. Another satellite orbits planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{y}\"></span> at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> from the centre of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>. The mass of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> and the mass of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4M\"></span>. What is the ratio of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{X}}{v_{y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.25</li><li data-label=\"B\">0.5</li><li data-label=\"C\">2.0</li><li data-label=\"D\">4.0</li></ol>"
